# Platform direction

- Public frontend is Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS in `web/`. Keep marketing pages component-driven.
- Custom CMS lives at `/admin` with Prisma/PostgreSQL. Do not add Payload.
- Keep public marketing pages component-driven and performance-aware.
- Use server-side capabilities only where they improve security, SEO, or data boundaries.
- Keep CMS concerns decoupled from the homepage until the custom admin scope is active.
